# --- Large binary trees: deliberately NOT in git ----------------------------
# Content is ~7 GB of .uasset and SourceAssets is ~50 GB of DCC source.
# Git cannot hold these sensibly without LFS. They are excluded so that the
# code, scripts, configuration and documentation are versioned immediately.
# To bring binaries under version control later, install Git LFS and track
# *.uasset / *.umap / *.fbx / *.blend before un-ignoring these directories.
/Content/
/SourceAssets/

